  "runtime_notes": [
    "The repository's StockTracker active-trader documents disagree (v1.4/v1.8/v1.9), while host process evidence on 2026-10-18 showed v1.10; consult the local active manifest.",
    "StockTracker's configured fallback is v1.9, not a verified currently deployed release.",
    "Scheduled task settings are inferred from the tracked installer script; host inventory must confirm them.",
    "Alpaca trader source must preserve PAPER_ONLY=True and TradingClient(...,paper=True).",
    "ZPTA specialist is imported by the trader for shadow-only research, not an independently managed Python process.",
    "Post-close reviews are launched from the paper trader and from the weekday Scheduled Task; both use post_close_review_policy.py, with three attempts per market session and 15-minute cooldown. No running trader reload is implied by a successful GitHub commit.",
    "Weekday EOD review task is 13:35 America/Los_Angeles on the Windows Pacific host; installer changes do not alter already-installed tasks. Operator uses infrastructure/apply_review_135.ps1 -Apply to update only the existing trigger."
  ],
